  "title": "Quick and Easy Chicken and Stuffing Casserole",
  "description": "Easy and delicious stovetop chicken noodle casserole. Chicken and noodles are baked with a layer of buttery stuffing creating a comforting weeknight casserole that will please the entire family.",
  "authors": [
